      "statement": "src/styles.css is structured in 8 sections: 1) Design tokens (CSS custom properties in :root), 2) Dark mode overrides (:root.dark), 3) Base (element-level defaults for box-sizing, body, typography, form controls, focus rings), 4) Default skin (semantic class hooks: .card, .btn-*, .form-field, .form-error, .success-msg, .muted, .badge, etc.), 5) Auth pages (.auth-page, .auth-card layout), 6) Config page (.config-page, .config-card for when apiUrl is not set), 7) Responsive (media queries for small screens), 8) Reduced motion (prefers-reduced-motion media query).",
