      "statement": "The accounts feature configuration covers frontend-url and frontend-app-url (both set to APP_URL), the features sub-document of derived toggles, and an oauth sub-document for Google credentials; the google oauth step runs only when environment.dev.ts has oauthLogin on and oauthProviders includes 'google', and fills client-id and client-secret from GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID and GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET via fromEnv only when the stored values are not already configured.",
