    {
      "id": "claim_c43f2884e2fc4eb492cfa4241eb5af94",
      "statement": "The consents user schema requires only _id and roles so registrations and invitations are not rejected, stores latestConsents.tos, latestConsents.pp and a BSON acceptedAt date typed with the escaped _$date key, and keeps consents as a history array; the _id requirement means direct PUT /users/{id} writes must include _id in the body.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.consents.ts#L60-L115",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:cd215cdfe4189aa32f8648fba181718befb3492cac47a158f3f65795d1abd2b0:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_12678793a152421781987f816fe5879c",
      "statement": "The consents guard rule blocks with status 451 when either current ToS or Privacy Policy version is missing from the token claims; its condition requires an authenticated caller, exempts /auth and /token prefixes and the acceptance PATCH itself, deliberately does not exempt /users/me so the client-side gate trips on session restore, and sets on_error to allow so an unevaluable rule cannot lock everyone out.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.consents.ts#L117-L153",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:49721f9df1b92beaf5fa95567d281ac2e34b7cd694e8a5692020ff853b838e4c:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.consents.ts#L282-L318",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:222a69de0c4aaa4290e8761e6daf18fd5a3314918a4f266435536639f630ef03:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9e60948a11f9445ea122e5469483e809",
      "statement": "The own-consents PATCH permission lets the user PATCH /users/{userId} only for their own id and only with consents in the request whitelist; its mergeRequest stamps latestConsents with TOS_VERSION, PP_VERSION and acceptedAt '@now' and $pushes the same record onto the consents history, so the client sends no versions and cannot accept terms it was never shown or backdate an acceptance.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.consents.ts#L220-L249",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:56499f2d0ad5eed28fb40c71ad06fe70a7a4e81e66811d8d67d473627ab1b050:"
        }
      ]
    },
